{"id":"655433","name":"胡萝卜玉米面发糕","author":"冬季心情","authorId":"8473848","desc":"","cover":"images/655433/cover.jpeg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"面粉","amount":"130g"},{"name":"玉米面","amount":"130g"},{"name":"发酵粉","amount":"2g"},{"name":"胡萝卜","amount":"210g"}],"sub":[{"name":"温水","amount":"170g"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备原料。","img":"images/655433/step_1.jpeg"},{"step":2,"desc":"胡萝卜切片。","img":"images/655433/step_2.jpeg"},{"step":3,"desc":"面粉和玉米面混合均匀，倒入发酵粉和温水的混合液，和成软一些的面团。","img":"images/655433/step_3.jpeg"},{"step":4,"desc":"加胡萝卜片，揉均匀。","img":"images/655433/step_4.jpeg"},{"step":5,"desc":"放入笼屉里。","img":"images/655433/step_5.jpeg"},{"step":6,"desc":"发酵1.5倍大小，上锅蒸30分钟。","img":"images/655433/step_6.jpeg"},{"step":7,"desc":"非常好吃的胡萝卜玉米面发糕，入口微甜，胡萝卜香气四溢。","img":"images/655433/step_7.jpeg"},{"step":8,"desc":"喜欢的朋友一起来做吧。","img":"images/655433/step_8.jpeg"}],"tips":"胡萝卜切薄片，用温水可以帮助发酵。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}